text:
Tua tangthu gen ka nuam hi, tunglam muhlouh thilte,
Jesu leh A thupina, Jesu leh A itna;
Tua tangthu gen ka nuam hi, a dik chih ka theih ziak,
Ka lungsim hon taisak hi, bangdangin taisak lou.
Tua tangthu gen ka nuam hi,
Thupina a ka la ding;
Tua tangthu luilui gen ding,
Jesu leh A itna.
Tua tangthu gen ka nuam hi, phuahtawm tangthu hoih leh,
Manglam thu hoihte sanga, lamdang leh ngaihnophuai;
Tua tangthu gen ka nuam hi, kei hon khoih mahmah hi;
Huaiziak’n tuin na kiangah, tua tangthu kon hilh hi.
Tua tangthu gen ka nuam hi, gen nonnon a leng hoih,
Ka gen tenga hoih deuhdeuh, ngaihnophuai lamdang hi;
Tua tangthu gen ka nuam hi, khenkhatte’n za ngeilou,
Pathian thu siangthou apan, hotdamna thupuak hoih.
Tua tangthu gen ka nuam hi, a thei hoih zaw semte’n,
A za ngeiloute bangin, ngainuam semsem uhi;
Thupina mun a la thak, Thak ka sak hun chiangin,
Sawt a ka na deih tawntung; tua tangthu lui hi ding.

Toupa Na thu mah hoihpen e,
Khovel sum tengteng sangin;
Toupa, Na thu mah hoihpen e,
Khovel thupina sangin;
Khuaizu sang in khumzaw,
Ka lungsim a taisak hi.
Gamkeu, gamdai a ka pai lai’n,
Na thu in honpi inla;
Hiai hi tung thangvan meipi vak;
Israel tate’n a zuih uh;
Kei honpi dingin leng,
A vakna mial tuanlou hi.
Nuai simlei tuisuahgiat tunga,
Lauthawng a ka pai lai in;
Mal aksi bangin Na thu in,
Van gam lampi honpi hen;
Huan honjui tawntung nu’ng,
Tangtawn a mang nawnlou in.
Khemna tuipi, khemna gal lian,
Khovel toh hondou mahleh;
Toupa honthuam in Na thu in,
Tua kha namtem hiampen in;
Laulou ding setan gal,
Nangmah hatna masuan in.

Jesu ah lawm khat ka mu, Amah kei di’n bangkim,
Ka kha adi’n sangsawm lak a hoihpen hi;
Phaijang Lilipak lun hi, Amah kia ah ka mu,
Hon sawpsiang ding leh damsak dia ka deih teng;
Dahna ah ka muanna hi, buaina ah ka bukna,
Mangbatna teng Amah ngatdi’n hon hilh.
Amah phaijang Lilipak hi,
Jingsol Aksi vak hi;
Ka kha adi’n sangsawm lak a hoihpen hi.
Aman ka lungkham lamang, ka dahna teng pua hi,
Khemna ah Amah ka innsang muan, kip hi;
Amah ziak’ ka bangkim nu-sia, milem teng susia,
Ka lung ah tuin A hatna’n hon kem hi;
Khovel in honpampaihin, Setan in hon khem zong,
Jesu vangin bittakin chiam tung ning.
Hon nusia ngeingeilou ding, hia’h hon taisan lou ding,
Ginna a hinga, A deihlam ka bawl lai’n;
Ka kim ah mei baang om tu’n bangmah lauding nei keng,
Manna in ka kha gilkial a taisak ding;
A melpha mu dingin thu-pina ah lengtou ning,
Kipahna lui luan tawntungna mun ah.

Kikholhna nuama kikhawm in,
Pathian ankuang i um jel;
Lungsim naisemin i kizom,
Tanghou balkhap nek laiin.
Bangdangteng sang’ manpha ankuang,
Nang leh kei dia itna lian;
I nek laiin Kris in hon huau;
“Non theihgigena’n hih un”.
Pathian hon itna tehvuallouh,
Itna’n van thil hoihpen pia;
Simzoh vuallouh gouin honlei,
Ei di’n A hinna pia hi.
Bangtengsa hoih Pathian ankuang,
Nang leh kei dia sisan pha;
I dawn laiin Kris in hon huau,
“Non theihgigena’n hih un”.

Toupa, non sapna aw nem za ung, Honjui un chih;
Na khekhapte hon mutheita ung, Na kiang’ honpi’n.
Jesu khekhap in i lampi vaksak hi,
Jesu paina khap i jui ding uh;
A paina peuh.
Khovot leh mial nua’h honpi mahleh, Belam zongin;
Siloam tuinak lam juan jel ni, Hatlou panpih’n.
Biak-inn siangthoua A honpi leh, Thu gen jel ni;
Tagah leh gentheite inn sung ah, A na sem in.
Kongpi vak kanin i pai jel jel, Kihei jel in;
Sithei lou nuamsate toh ton in, Van kholai ah.
Tunglama Aman honna muh chian, I zinna zou;
Pa mangtutphah Jesu khap tawpna, Ma’h i khawl ding.

Aw, mi sangtampi’n la sa ding,
Toupa min pahtawi in om hen;
Ka Pathian leh Kumpi thupi,
Toupa min pahtawi in om hen.
A  min thupi hen, A min thupi hen,
Toupa min pahtawi in om hen;
A min thupi hen, A min thupi hen,
Toupa min pahtawi in om hen.
Jesu min in launa beisak,
Toupa min pahtawi in om hen;
Mikhialte zak a ging kilawm,
Toupa min pahtawi in om hen.
Kei, mikhial kha tan di’n hong si,
Toupa min pahtawi in om hen;
A si in khelhna teng maisak,
Toupa min pahtawi in om hen.
Chiklai mahin ngilh kei ning e,
Toupa min pahtawi in om hen;
Jesu’n ka moh a sawpsiang ni;
Toupa min pahtawi in om hen.

Gospel dak hong ging hi,
Tuipi leh gamchih tung ah;
Hotdamna tangthupha manbei,
Nang leh kei di’n hontun hi;
“Pathian in khovel it,
A Tapa khat neihsun pia;
Kua leng Amah ging peuhmah in,
Tangtawn hinna nei ding hi.”
Gospel dak hong ging e,
Tuipi leh gamchih tung ah;
Tangthupha, manneilou,
Nang leh kei di’n hontun hi.
Gospel dakin hon chial hi;
Miteng dia lui, ankuang ah;
A hon chialna ngaineu kenla,
Tua sapna pha nial sam ken;
“Hinna tanghou ka hi,
Kha gilkial aw honne in;
Na khelhnate sandup mahleh,
Vuk bangin hong ngou ding hi.”
Gospel dak ging kipahhuai,
Aging in gamla za thawn;
Ngaihdamna bukim thu honpuak,
Hondampa hong sih ziak in;
“Tangthupha kipahhuai,
Miteng di’n ka hontun hi;
Nou di’n Hondampa hong piang hi,
Kris Toupa leh kumpipa.”

Hangtak in van sepaihte aw,
Laulou in malam nawt jel un;
Toupa Jesu honpipa hi,
Kalvari a A zohsa hi;
I Toupa honpipa’n.
I Toupa honpipa’n. (3)
Gam nuam a hontun ding;
Gam nuam a hontun ding, (3)
I Toupa honpipa’n.
Hangtak in van sepaihte aw,
Sihna leh natna paisan un;
Toupa Jesu honpipa hi,
Han apan vualzou in thounawn;
I Toupa honpipa’n.
Hangtak in van sepaihte aw,
Paisuak ni aksi khen gam ah;
Toupa Jesu honpipa hi,
A inn a hon tun ngei ding hi;
I Toupa honpipa’n.

Mipil sanga pilzaw laibu khat om,
Pathian a pan pilna bu hi;
Apek sungteng thupina in vak hi;
Leitung hoihnate’n khupzou lou.
Bible ahi, Bible hi,
Lei apan van a pitu Aksi vak;
Bible ahi, Bible hi
Pathian hon piak Thudik Bu;
Manpha i it hi.
Thupina a ei honpitu vak hi,
Khasiangthou namsau thahat hi;
Atangthu kilawmte theigige le’ng,
Van kipahna nuampen ahi.
Hinna tuinak luanna mun hon hilh hi,
Khelhna nin pan i kha sawpsiang;
Kumsawt a i lungkhamna heh honnem,
I natnate lei toh honkhen.

Jesu itna zaila’n sa ni,
A hehpihna, zahngaihna;
Thangvan inn vak, tenna nunnuam,
Ei a dingin hong langta.
Vangam nuam i tun chiangin,
Lailung damna ni thupi hi ding hi;
Jesu mel i muh chian,
Vualtungtuanna zaila’n sa ni.
Thangvan tuanglam i zuihlai in,
Lungkham lummei hong jing ding;
Hizong khualzin i zoh chiangin,
Lungsim tawl meibang theng ding.
Ahi eite muanhuai ve ni;
Niteng A na sem ve ni;
A thupina tomkal muh zong,
Sepgim toh kithaman ding.
I ma a kipahman delh in,
Jesu kilawmna mu ding;
Suang manpha kong kihong pah ding,
Sana vangkhotual leng ni.

Aw hehpihna khovel vakna,
Kalvari tang sing kros tung ah;
Ka Toupa’n A hong bawl,
Ka ngaihtuah chiang lamdang lua sa’ng;
Sihna mulkimhuai kei di’n thuak
A sisan hong luangkhia. (2)
Hehpihna dim Toupa’n hongthuak,
Lungngaih mauna gawtmun apan;
Hon tankhe zouta hi,
Gensiatbei Toupa ziak laukha;
Thangvan tual ah nibang tang in,
Leng kum tawntung dingin. (2)
Toupa chitna, hoihna, phatna,
Simthu zaila’n lel theilou hi;
Pahtawi uh thangvan ah,
Toupa Mangtutphah tung a tu;
Serafimte’n zaila’n pak uh,
En leng pak sam ve ni. (2)
I ngaklah ni hong tung zok ding,
I Toupa honpi khawmna ding;
Toupa mel muta ni,
Khensa vualngaih u leh nau mu’n;
Tangtawn khopi tual ah leng ning,
Lawp veng lailung juang veng. (2)
Khovel tawp chian thangvan tual ah,
A tatsa teng kikhawm ding hi;
Nunnuam sawlbang hei ding,
Tua ah lungkham, buai, kahnate;
Sih, kikhen, luankhi nul omlou,
Nuam in kumveita ni. (2)

Sisan pha, sisan pha, Sing kros tung a luang in;
Khelhna pan hontan in, Mohsa dik hon tangsak;
Mohna a ninpen zong sianna,
Kalvari sisan pha ahi. (2)
Aw sisan, sisan pha’n, Van kong hon honsak hi;
Van gam ka tun chiangin, Ka la tullou ding hi;
Sisan, sisan, sisan, sisan,
Chi-in tawplouin sata ning. (2)
Tang minthang Kalvari, Mite’n simmoh mahleh;
Tang dang tengteng sangin, Ken zaw ngaizaw veng e;
Aw nopna tang, aw mun siangthou,
Pathian sisan a luanna hi. (2)

Tangthu luilui hon hilh in,
Muhlouh tunglam thilte;
Jesu leh A thupina,
Jesu leh a itna;
Theih baihlamin hon hilhin,
Naupangte hilh bangin;
Hatlou leh tawl ka hihziak’n.
Hihtheih neilou leh nin.
Tangthu luilui hon hilh in (3)
Jesu leh A itna.
Awl in tangthu hon hilh in,
Ka theihtheihna dingin;
Tua tatkhiakna thu lamdang;
Pathian bawl, khelh damna;
Tangthu hon hilh jeljel in,
Ka mangngilh pahpah ziak’n,
“Jingsang daitui” sun chiangin.
A kang beimang pah hi.
Zaidam in tangthu hon hilh’n,
Chitak, ngaihsak kawmin;
Khial ka hi chih thei gige’n,
Hondam di’n Jesu hong;
Tangthu hon hilh gige in,
Na chihtaktak dia leh,
Mangbatna hun peuh ah leng;
Hon khamuantu hi in.
Tangthu lui mah hon hilh in,
Lauh ding na neih chiangin;
Hiai khovel thupinate’n
Siatna thupi hon tun;
Ahi, khovel thupina,
Ka kha a hong suah chian,
Tangthu luilui hon hilh in;
“Kris Jesu’n hon damsak.”

Aw, Pathian, tang a hon panpih,
Machiang ka lamet uh;
Lumbang hon sung tung khonim theng,
Kumsawt inn hoih, Nangmah.
Na tutkhawlna mangtutphah lim,
Misiangthoute’n nuamsa;
Na khut in honpi honkai in,
Ka bit ding uh, Toupa.
Gammual tangbang kikhun ma in,
Leitung a om khiak ma’n;
Pathian hi chia tangtawn, tangtawn;
Kumsawt tulmoh Na hi.
Nang dingin kum za tampi zong,
Mit phiatkal a ching lou;
Tuma, tunung, kou ka chih uh;
Nang, tu Na chi gige.
Hun in chiautuipi luang bang in,
Mihingte taimang hi;
Zan a mang, jingkal a bei bang;
Mihingte ngilh in om.
Aw, Pathian, tang a hon panpih,
Machiang ka lamet uh;
Ka damsung un hon chingpa hi’n,
Ka tangtawn inn uh hi’n.

Arr. L.O. Sanderson
Aw thupha thehzak un,
Mihing omna peuh ah;
Mihing lungsim sung ah,
Mi lungkhamte kiang ah;
Kristian tengteng kam in,
Thu kipahhuai phuang hen,
Toupate Toupa hi.
Toupate Toupa hi,
Pathian thuhing ahi;
A min ngaihnophuai hi,
A thu’n tatna hontun;
Aw hiai thu thehzak un,
Mihing omna peuh ah;
Kumpite Kumpi hi.
Kumpite Kumpi lian,
Ngaiin, damna kha zak;
Kha saltang teng kiang ah,
Tatna bukim hontun;
Suahtakna inn sung pan,
Vualzohna la hong ging;
Kumpite Kumpi hi.
Pathian itna zilza,
Hiai ka lei in bangchi’n;
Vakvaite a hilh diam?
Hehpihna tehvuallouh;
Leia ka sih nung chian,
A mel puin taang ning;
Van ah Amah thuin.

Aw tua thugen thupi leh khum, ginna a lak ding;
Jan leh tuni leh tangtawn in, Jesu a ngeingei.
Khialte ngaidam nuam lailai hi, na leh sa damsak;
Dahte nemin huihpi daisak, Amin thupi hen.
Jan leh tuni leh tangtawnin, Jesu a ngei ngei;
Bangteng dang zong Jesu danglou,
A min thupi hen (3)
Bangteng dang zong Jesu danglou,
A min thupi hen.
Mimang nang hondam di’n hon zong, amah khialte Lawm;
Khial aw, A khe phungah hong in, kisik in kun in;
Siamlouh kon tangsak kei ding hi, pai in, khial nawn ken;
Chi a sawtlam a A gen bang, na kiangah tu’n gen.
Leitung a na-leh-sa damsak, A khut thahat in;
Tu’n zong i natna leh lungkham, A thupiakin bei;
Numei khoih a damna pepa’n, damna pethei lai,
Kuapeuh ginnaa ngente kiang, tua bangzah pe ding.
Emau khua juan amau toh ton, omkhawm lai dingin;
Tuabangin damsung lampi ah, Aman hon tonpih;
A mel munawn pah ding hihang, Toupa hongkin ve;
Hizong Jesu ngeimah hi ding, van a pai pen mah.

Jesu ka laukha itpa,
Na angah honpi jel in;
Khemna tuipi hong nai chian,
Khemna tui kihawt sang ah;
Aw, Hondampa hon seel in,
Damsung huihpi a then pha’n;
Na van bitna’h honpi in,
Nangin ka laukha nei in.
Kingakna ding dang nei keng,
Chimoh ka kha Nang ah om;
Aw kei kia’n hon nuse ken,
Hon vak inla, hon nem in;
Ka muanna teng Nang ah om,
Hon huh gige Nang na hi;
Venlouh ka lu hon khuh in,
Na khazak limin sung in.
Aw Kris Nang kia hi ka deih,
Nang ah bangkim ka muta;
Pukte phong in bah halhsak,
Nate damsak’n, mittaw pi’n;
Na min dik in siangthou hi,
Keizaw lepchiahna ngen hi’ng;
Khelhna leh zuau a dim hi’ng,
Nang thutak, itna’n Na dim.
Ka khelhna tengteng khuh di’n,
Na hehpihna tampi mu’ng;
Damna lui ching in luang hen,
Huai ah hon bawl, hon kem in;
Hinna tuinak Nang na hi,
Man beiin hon dawn sak in;
Ka lungsung ah nak nei in,
Tangtawn dong in hong luang in.

Toupa A hongpai nawn ding hi,
Hongpai ding kisa ni;
A van inn hoih pan hongpai ding,
Hongpai ding kisa ni;
I diktanna Toupa ahi,
A mitelte vualjawl di’n hong;
A Pa mangthutphah ma’h gum ding,
Hongpai ding kisa ni.
Mouneipa hongpai chian na mansiang diam? (2)
Jing hiam, sun hiam, zanlai hiam:
Na khawnvak bawlsa vaakin,
Mouneipa hongpai chian na mansiang diam?
Huihkhua ah hongpai nawn pah ding,
Hongpai ding kisa ni;
Vannuai pumpi thukhenna ding,
Hongpai ding kisa ni;
Jesu’n tatna hon tut chiangin,
Vantung mi’n Halleluijah chi’n;
Kumpi tuak di’n khawnvak bawl un,
Hongpai ding kisa ni.
Ngaiin michih kiang tung dingin,
Hongpai ding kisa ni;
Pengkul sapna i za pah ding,
Hongpai ding kisa ni;
A thupiakin thukhenna sam,
Gamchih, munchih a kipanin;
Mangtutphah ma’h i ding vek ding,
Hongpai ding kisa ni.

Kalvari zohna thupipen,
Angelte’n lambang a pak uh;
Mite’n Amah a phat chiat uh,
Khovel Hondampa’ sisan in;
Mi mang ding a hon tankheta,
Kina a kituaksakta hi.
Mual minthangpen sang’n Kalvari,
Nakpi in a minthangzaw hi;
Huai ah hotdamna nak a lang,
Mihing tenna ah hong luang khia;
Mite kiang hinna hon peta,
Kumsawt hinna tuinak hi ding.

Kipahna aw ging i za,
Jesu in hondam hi;
Aw thupha na theh zak un,
Jesu in hondam hi;
Gamchih ah a thu pua un,
Tang leh guam tuipi kan in;
Masawn un Toupa’n thu pia,
Jesu in hondam hi.
Tuikhang luang tung ah pua un,
Jesu in hondam hi;
Gamla, nai’ khialte hilh un,
Jesu in hondam hi;
Nou tuikulh gamte’n sa un,
Tui kihot in posawn hen;
Leitung in pahna nei ding,
Jesu in hondam hi!
Galdou buai ah leng sa un,
Jesu in hondam hi;
A sih leh hin tawntungna’n,
Jesu in hondam hi;
Mangbatna ah aw nem in,
Hehpihna zong mite kiang’h;
Sa un, hantung vualzoh la,
Jesu in hondam hi!
Huihpi’n aw thupi suah hen,
Jesu in hondam hi;
Namchih tu’n kipakta hen,
Jesu in hondam hi;
Hotdamna kim leh manbei,
Tangsang leh guamte’n hilh un;
Hiai i vualzohna la uh,
Jesu in hondam hi!

Toupa Na gam ka it hi,
Nangmah tenna inn ngei;
Hon Tanpa’n sisan manpha a,
A tatsa Saptuam hi;
Pathian Saptuam ka it,
A baangte Na ma’ ding;
Mitnauta banga Na hawmthoh,
Na khuta kigelhsa.
Khitui luangin it ning,
Ka thumsakna tungtou;
Amah di’n gim khawksalou in,
Sepgim buaina beima’n;
A van lampi zuih khawng,
Ka kipahnapen hi;
Toupa Nitakan, kichiamna,
Itna phatna late.
Jesu Nang lawm siangthou,
Hondampa leh Kumpi;
Na khutin thaang leh melma pan,
A hon honkhe jel ding;
Na thutak om den ding,
Zion piakin om ding;
Leitung thupina kilawm teng,
Van nopna tengteng zong.

Jesu tangthu kei hon hilh in,
Ka lung sungah hon gelh in;
Tangthu manpha pen hon hilh in,
Zaknop, ngaihnophuai penpen;
Angelte lapawl hon hilh in,
A pian a muahna la uh;
Tungnungpen Pathian thupi hen,
Leitung ah lemthu leng hen.
Jesu tangthu kei hon hilh in,
Ka lung sungah hon gelh in;
Tangthu manpha pen hon hilh in,
Zaknop ngaihnop huai penpen.
A damlai nite hon hilh in,
Khattang gamdai a an ngawl;
I khelhnate ziak’n khemin om,
Atawp ah Amah vualzou;
A sepgim kumte hon hilh in,
Lungkham A thuak hon hilh in;
Muhdah leh hih duhdah A thuak,
Innbei, deihlouh leh genthei.
A kilhden na kros thu hon hilh’n,
Nat leh gawtna thuak a thum;
A sial na han thu hon hilh in,
A hin nawn thu hon hilhin;
Tua itna tangthu nou ngii ngei,
Ka muh sangin chiang zaw hi;
En in chi’n kapkawm in hon huau,
Itna’n ka tatna pezou.

Ginna’n hon entou ing,
Kalvari Belamnou;
Ka Hondampa;
Ka thumna ngaikhia in;
Ka mohna teng lakhia’n.
Tunia pat ka pumin Nanga hihen.
Ka lungsim bahnate,
Hehpihna’n hatsakin;
Hong hihhalh in;
Kei di’n hong sita chia;
Aw, nang ka hon itna,
Meikuang siang bangin mit thei keileh chi’ng.
Damsung mial ka pai lai’n,
Lungkhamna’n hon tuam chian;
Nang honpi in;
Mial, sunvak suaksak in,
Dahna khitui nulsiang’n;
Nanga kipan hon pialmangsak nawn ken.
Damsung tomchik bei chian,
Sihna lui dai lauhuai;
Kong tun chiangin;
Hondampa non itna’n,
Lau, ginlelh paimangin;
Ka kha tatsa’n tunglam Hon kai pihin.

Thumna hun nuam, Thumna hun nuam,
Lungngaihna khovel pan honsam;
Ka Pa mangtutphah ma’ kun in,
Taksap leh deih teng vahilh ding;
Dahna leh lungkhamna ah leng,
Ka laukha in muanna mu jel,
Khemhatpa thaang ka pelkhe jel,
Nong kiknawn chian, Thumna hun nuam.
Thumna hun nuam, Thumna hun nuam,
Kipah vualjawlna ka muh teng;
Ka kha nang ngaiin a mau hi,
Na hong kik ngak a ka om sung;
Pathian ka Hondampa’n A mel,
Alahna mun ka juanpah hi;
Kipak in ka khawldenta hi,
Hon na ngak ing, Thumna hun nuam.
Thumna hun nuam, Thumna hun nuam,
Ka ngetnate na kha’n paw dia;
Amah thudik leh gin om kiang’h,
A na ngak khate vualjawl di’n;
A sakmel zong di’n a honsawl,
A hehpihna muang, A thu ging’n;
Ka buainate Amah guan ning,
Hon na ngak ing, Thumna hun nuam.
Thumna hun nuam, Thumna hun nuam,
Na hehnepna ka mu dinga;
Pisgah tangsang tung tanpha in,
Ka inn galetin ka pai jel;
Hiai taksa puan nusia’n thou ning,
Tangtawn kipahman sang dingin;
Huihkhua ah hiai ka chita ding-
“Mangpha, Mangpha, Thumna hun nuam.”

A than in hong thang kimvel hen;
Kalvari ah khua hong vak hen,
A vak kawlmong pha’n vaksuak hen;
A vak kawlmong pha’n vaksuak hen.
Toupa Pathian, Na nasepna,
Simlei tung, vannuai pha’n thang hen;
Na hehpihna nuaisiah theihlouh,
Vannuai tengah kithehzak hen;
Vannuai tengah kithehzak hen.

Saptuam kingakna khat kia,
Toupa Jesu Kris hi;
Amah thilsiam thak ahi,
Tui leh thu a siamthak;
Van a pan hong kum’ hong zong
A mou siangthou hidi’n;
Amah sisan ngei in lei,
A hinna di’n hong si.
Namchih a pan telkhawmte,
Lei ah pumkhat hi uh;
Hotdam hih’ pianthakna khat,
Toupa khat, ginna khat;
Minsiangthou khat a vualjawl.
An siangthou khat nekhawm;
Lam-etna khat kia hon phut,
Hehpihna a thuam in.
Vakvai bang’ simmoh huai in,
Mite’n nuaisiah mahleh;
Kikhenna in khendalh zong,
Ngaihdan tuamin nuai zong;
Hizong misiangthoute’n kem,
“Bangtan ding hiam,” chi uh;
Kahna zanmial beipah ding,
Jing kipah la suak ding.
Sepgim leh gimthuakna ah,
Galdouna haksa ah;
Mei a hihsiangna ngakin,
Tangtawn a muanna ding;
A vangletna a et chian,
Ngaklah mit hampha ding;
A Saptuam vualzou vanglian,
Khawldenna hita ding.

Sem in, zan hongtung ding hi,
Jingkho tawnin sem in;
Sem in, jing daikia lak ah,
Loupak dawn lak ah;
Ni hong san in leng sem in,
Sem in, nisa nuai ah;
Sem in, zan hongtung ding hi,
Mite na zoh hun.
Semin, zan hongtung ding hi,
Sun nisa nua’h sem in;
Avak phat laiin sem in,
Khawl hun tungpah ding;
Mitphiat kalteng dimsak in,
Banghiam koihching dingin;
Sem in, zan hongtung ding hi,
Mite seplouh hun.
Sem in, zan hongtung ding hi,
Van a nitum nuai ah;
Avak liai sungteng sem in,
Sun vak lah kiamkiam,
Khovak tawptan in sem in,
Vak nawnlou dia bei ding;
Sem in, zanmial hongtung ding,
Nasep bei ding hun.

Thumna dia vualjawl hun hi,
Lungsim kiniamkhiak in;
Hondampa leh lawm Jesu kiang ah i kikhawm;
Ginna in Amah juan le’ng. Aman hon veng ding hi;
Tawlte di’n tawldamna hi, aw, huaia om nuampen!
Thum hun vualjawl lai’n (2)
Tawlte di’n tawldamna hi,
Aw, huaia om nuampen!
Thumna dia vualjawl hun hi,
Hondampa hong nai chian;
Lainatna nunnem in A tate thumna ngai;
I buainate a khebul anga dia honchih lai;
Tawlte di’n tawldamna hi, aw, huaia om nuampen!
Thumna dia vualjawl hun hi,
Ze-et leh khem thuakte’n
Amau it Hondampa kiang’h lungkhamna hilh in;
Aman hehpihna lung in, buaina teng lamang hi,
Tawlte di’n tawldamna hi, aw huaia om nuampen!
Thumna dia vualjawl hun ah,
Amah muang in ging hang,
I taksap a vualjawlna, i mu ngei ding chih,
Hiai muanna buching lak ah, i buaina teng bei ding,
Tawlte di’n tawl damna hi, aw, huai a om nuampen.

Khemna ah lut kenla, lut khelhna ahi,
Vualzohna’n hon panpih ding, midang zou di’n;
Hangsan in dou jel in, mial ngaih nusia in;
Jesu en gige in, Aman honpi ding.
Panpih Hondampa ngen in,
Lungmuan, hihhat, hon kem ding;
Aman hon panpih ding hi,
Aman honpi ding hi.
Lawm gilou taisan in, kamsia zanglou in,
Pathian min zah inla mawka genlou in;
Migi phatuamngai leh lungsim diktak in,
Jesu en gige in, Aman honpi ding.
A vualzoute Pathian in Manglukhu pia,
Ginna in i zou ding, puk san jel mah le’ng;
Hondampa’n i hatna thak sak jel jel ding,
Jesu en gige in, Aman honpi ding.

Kongkhak bul ah Mikhual om, lut sak in,
Tua’h na om nilouh ta hi, lut sak in;
Lut sak in, a pai ma in,
Lut sak in, Mi siangthou hi;
Jesu Kris, Pathian Tapa, lut sak in.
Tu’n na lungsim hong inla, lut sak in,
Na hal leh paiman ding hi, lut sak in;
Lut sak in, na lawm ahi,
Na kha gum ngeingei ding hi,
A tawp pha’n hon kemding hi, lut sak in.
A aw khumtak na za na’m? lut sak in,
Tumah in Amah tel in, lut sak in;
Na kongkhak bul ah ding hi,
Kipahna honpe nawn ding;
Huan, A min na it ding hi, lut sak in.
Van mikhual tu’n lutsak in, lut sak in,
Nang di’n ankuang A lui ding, lut sak in;
Na khelh ngaihdam hon hilh dia,
Huan lei toh i kikhen chian,
Van inn ah nang honpi ding, lut sak in.

Mi itna in Na dim;
Tembang kideih amau gel,
Simthu pha toh gawm in;
Na vangletna dawntuak in,
Na vang honjou uhen;
Phamna’n gibang khen ma teng,
Simthu chiam pel lou di’n.
Hiai leitunga Nong len lai,
Kana vangkhua Na hei;
Lambang Na pak kitenna,
Uain nek nuam joupi’n;
Uain bangin amau gel,
Taksapna uh guan in;
Na min honlou jel uhen,
Tangbang a damsung un.
Amau gel paibang kopna’n,
Na Simthu hoih mahmah;
Inn tum suang a phungching in,
Toupa tuibang tung in.
Amau Nang lumbang sung in,
Siangsung phungching dingin;
Lambang pak ung, Toupa min,
Na banjal ah nga ung.

Nichin in kon ngai hi, itsiam Toupa;
Na aw nem bang omlou, muanna pe thei.
Kon ngai hi, aw kon ngai hi,
Nichin in kon ngai hi;
Aw hon vualjawl’n Hondampa,
Nang kon juan hi.
Nichin in kon ngai hi, ka kiang’h om in;
Khemnate tha bei hi, Nang nong nai chian.
Nichin in kon ngai hi, nop leh dahna’h;
Hong mengin hon ompih’n, Nang lou hin bei.
Nichin in kon ngai hi, Nang siangthou pen;
Aw, Nanga hon hisak’n, nuamsa Tapa.

Jesu muan a lungdamhuai pen,
A thugen khempeuh gintak;
A thuchiam a kingak lel a;
“Toupa’n a chi,” chih i theih.
Jesu, Jesu ka muang mahmah,
Muanhuai hi ka chian gige;
Jesu, Jesu, manpha Jesu,
Hehpihna, Amah muan ding.
Aw, Jesu muan lungdamhuai hi,
Sawpsiangna A sisan muan;
Ginna mawltakin ka bual a,
Sianna, damna, sisan ah.
Ahi, Jesu muan lungdamhuai,
Khelhna, kisaktheihna bei;
Hinna, khawlna, nopna, muanna,
Jesu apan ka muta.
Nang muan ding ka theih kipak ing,
Manpha Jesu, Hondam Lawm;
Ka kiang ah na om chih ka thei,
Atawp pha’n non ompih ding.

Mang, mangin lei nopna, Jesu keia;
Beita in kizopna, Jesu keia;
Gamdai khomialna hi, Lei in khawlmun neilou,
Jesu kia in nuamsak, Jesu keia.
Ka kha khem manglou aw, Jesu keia,
Hia’h om gige taleng, Jesu keia;
Lei vante mangthei hi, ni khat lel damdia piang,
Ka lungsim pan paimang, Jesu keia.
Mangpha, zan a mangte, Jesu keia;
Phalvak chiangin mang hi, Jesu keia;
Ka kha’n a tup tengteng, bangmahlou, nguina lel,
Jesu’n lungkimsak zaw, Jesu keia.

Kris di’n muanhuaiin ginom in,
A puanlap kiphalh hen;
Khovel pumpi lak zoh ma in,
Sangpi in khaisang un.
Kris Toupa di’n ginom’n,
Aman honton pih ding;
Na buaina teng hon panpih ding,
Kris Toupa di’n ginom’n.
Kris di’n muanhuaiin ginom in,
Hangsan kipia deih hi;
Khelhna thilhihtheihna nang di’n;
Lauhna, hehna’ tailou.
Kris di’n muanhuai in ginom in,
Na ginna chihtakna;
Nasep hoih in lak gige in,
Na itna neih tengteng.
Kris di’n muanhuai in ginom in,
Amah na lawm hi ding;
Na damsung lohchinna dingin,
Hon hum’hon vengbit ding.

Jing nisuak vak loupi bang a,
Pathian Tapa hongkum chiang;
A vanglian vak, khua vannuai a mi’n mu ding,
Kawl kimvel a namchih lai a;
Amah’ midik samkhawm ding,
Tatsa mite kikhopna loupi hi ding.
Tungnungpen a kikhopna nuam,
Nop kiam theilou gam a kikhopna;
Hehpihna gam tungnungpen kikhopna,
Tatsate ten-na khopi nuam;
Tungnung pen a kikhopna.
Thianmang tung a lungdamna mu,
Phamsa thelbang hong thoh chian,
Hankuang sung leh tuipi jalna tuangnung sia’n,
Kituakkhawm ding thangvan zawl ah;
Tung kawlvabang lamtou ding,
Si leh hingte kituah khawmna om ding hi.
Thangvan khopi sunni bang tang,
Nat leh sat omlouhna gam;
Awlna luipi gei a i kimuh chiangin,
Thianmang siang ah phamsate toh;
Thangvan nunnuam in leng ni,
Khen nawnlou dia kikhopna ni hiding hi.
Toupa Jesu hongkum hun ding,
Niteng in hongnai deuhdeuh;
Mitphiat kallou a limdanna ding hongnai,
A chiam ni loupi hongnaita;
Mitphiat kallou limdang in,
Thangvan khopi i tungtou ding denchiangin.

Mialna omlou ding Jesu hongpai chian,
Mialna om nawn lou ding A hongpai chian;
Mialna om nawn lou ding A hongpai chian;
A itte pikhawm dingin.
A itte pikhawm dingin
A itte pikhawm dingin
Mialna om nawn lou ding A hongpai chian;
A itte pikhawm dingin.
Lungkham omlou ding Jesu hongpai chian,
Lungkham om nawn lou ding A hongpai chian;
Jingsang thupina toh A hongpai chian,
A itte pikhawm dingin.
Kahna omlou ding Jesu hongpai chian,
Kahna om nawn lou ding A hongpai chian;
Vualjawlna i tang ding A hongpai chian,
A itte pikhawm dingin.
Kipah la sa ding Jesu hongpai chian,
Kipahna la sa ding A hongpai chian;
Nuam in kimukhawm ni A hongpai chian,
A itte pikhawm dingin.

Aw, i vek in pang chiatni,
I lung leh hatna toh;
Toupa, Heutu na sem ding,
A na ah kipak ni;
Sep masa pahman in jui-
Hi, chih theigige ni;
Pa deihlam hih thuman ah,
Nopna hong luangkhia ding.
Kris leh Saptuam di’n,
Pe vek ung, aw Toupa;
Kris leh Saptuam di’n,
Aw, hing thei gige le’ng.
Aw, i vek in pang chiat ni,
Khovel Kris dia la ding;
Lamlian kongzingte zongin,
Khialpan mi hotdam ding;
Tangthupha pekhia dingin,
Khovel tengteng kiangah;
Namchih chichihte’n aging,
Kipahhuai zak mateng.
Aw, i vek in pang chiat ni,
Kris Saptuam bawl dingin;
A nasep a ginom in,
I bangkim pevek in;
A danthute juiin, A
Hehpihna ngaihsak in;
Kris batna tha a khang in,
I damsung bei matan.

Toupa leh A thilhihtheihna ah hat unla,
A thudik gum in kiptakin ding un;
Galdou ding sah lak ah leng,
Aman honpi suak dinga;
Toupa min in melma na nuaisiah ding.
Thudik di’n dingkip in,
Kumpi thupiak a vualzou dingin;
Toupa zahna ding ahi,
A thudik vualzou ding;
Toupa hatna ah i dingkip ding.
Toupa leh A thilhihtheihna ah hat unla,
Melmate ma a tai ngeilou dingin;
Thudik gum a na dou chian,
Na kiang ah hon dinpih ding;
Amah thahatna suang in masuan un.
Toupa leh A thilhihtheihna ah hat unla,
A thuchiamte zuau ngeingeilou ding hi;
Thudik gum a na dou chian,
Na taklam ban ah len ding,
Vualzou jeljel dingin Amah muang in.

A thu itna thuchiam kipahhuai hi,
Thupha zaktheih tengteng sang a manpha zaw hi;
Kris lungsim siangthou hi,
Khelhna neilou;
Amah keidi’n etton leh chiin dingpen ahi.
Honpina’h ka jui ding,
Lamtawn a juiin;
Honpina’h ka jui ding,
Niteng Jesu ka jui ding.
Jesu itna nem ngiingeii kipahhuai,
Mihing theih a itna om teng sang a hoihzaw;
Khialte hehpihsiam hi,
Amah muanhuai;
Amah kei di’n etton leh chiin dingpen ahi.
It a “Ka kiang ‘hongun” a chih ngai un,
Tawl a puakgik pote nou di’n khawlna nuam om;
A thuchiam ging unla,
Muanhuai leh kip;
Hondampa ah kinga’n huchi’n na kha bit ding.

Ngaiin hinna tui sisan pha,
Tuin a luangta hi;
Tua Lui Hondampa sisan hi,
Vuk sang a ngouna hi;
Vuk sang a ngouna hi.
Vuk sang a ngouna ah tu’n vabual in,
Kuapeuh a bual nuamnuam huai ah,
Mohna a sawpsiang ding.
Hondampa’n Kalvari mual ah,
Lungkham tak a thuak in;
Tua ah sisan vanglian a pawt,
Vuk sang a ngouna hi;
Vuk sang a ngouna hi.
Aw i vek in i pai thei ding,
Tua sisan lui luang ah;
Tua sisan vanglian kia muang in,
Vuk sang a ngouna hi;
Vuk sang a ngouna hi.
Hon-gum Toupa hong kum suk chian,
A mite a pi ding;
Tatna sisan kia muangte in,
Thangvan gam a tang ding;
Thangvan gam a tang ding.

Damsung hoihpen zong tom lua,
Singnah pulh bang in kia hi;
Buhphal gakkhawm bang in keu, kin meng in;
Tung sunni tuibang kiam toh,
Sihna hongtung pah ding hi;
A hunlai na pelkha ding, kin meng in!
Kin meng in, Kin meng in,
Jesu aw in hon saplai’n kin meng in!
Sual a na tamden aleh,
Hinna kong hon mulou in,
Na kah hang geilawta ding, kin meng in!
Pak hoihpente zong vuai pah,
Khanglai kilawmna bei jel;
Aw omom sawt nawnta ken, kin meng in,
Pathian kha in hon chiallai’n;
Mikhial, vak vak nawnta ken,
Lam-etna bei in om ken, kin meng in!
Adak, ani bei hulhul,
Sih leh thukhenna naita;
Jesu angsung juan inla, kin meng in,
Aw a manphatdan sim ve,
Sihna lui na kan ma in;
Na kha gawtmun a man ma’n, kin meng in!
Khial aw, vauna aw ngaiin,
Toupa, na deihpen hisak’n;
Huan van teng kipak ding hi, kin meng in,
Mial apan vak hon juan in;
Hongin, Jesu’n hon bawl hen,
Hongin, tuzan van juan in, kin meng in!

Benjamin Schmolke
Ka Jesu, Na deih bang’n,
Aw kei deih hong hileh;
Non itna khut sung ah,
Ka bangkim ka pe ding;
Nopna, dahna ah leng,
Nang a bang’n hon bawl in;
Toupa Na thu hihen,
Chi thei di’n hon panpih’n.
Ka Jesu, Na deih bang’n,
Tasam leh liangvaite;
Na mite tanghou tan,
Pellou in hon pia in;
Na thutak Manna bang’,
Ka kha hon vakta in;
Thildang teng a bei zong,
Toupa Na thu hihen.
Ka Jesu, Na deih bang’n,
Khitui tampi lak ah;
Ka lamet aksi vak,
Mial in tummang kei hen;
Lei ah nong kapta a,
Lungkham dah nong thuakta;
Nang toh kap khawm dingin,
Toupa, Na thu hihen.
Ka Jesu, Na deih bang’n,
Bangteng kei ah hoih hen;
Hun kikheng ding ah leng,
Kipakin kon muang ding;
Tunglam a ka inn ah,
Khawllouin ka pai ding!
Sihna’h hinna’h la sa’n,
Toupa Na thu hihen.

Jingkhua vak in van zem,
Ka lung phawngin kikou;
Jesu Kris phat hihen,
Sep leh thum hun ah zong;
Jesu kiang ka tai jel,
Jesu Kris phat hihen.
Tangtawn nopna van ah,
Hiai la ngaihpen ahi;
Jesu Kris phat hihen,
Lei leh van leh tuipi’n,
Thukpi, sangpi’n dawng hen;
Jesu Kris phat hihen.
Ka damsung nite in,
Hiai ka phatla hihen;
Jesu Kris phat hihen,
Hiai ka tangtawn la hi,
Tangtawn, tangtawn dongin;
Jesu Kris phat hihen.
Zan mial sun hongsuak jel.
Hiai i sak theih chiangin;
Jesu Kris phat hihen,
Mial hatna taimang jel,
Hiai thu a zak chiangin;
Jesu Kris phat hihen.

Kipahna tuipi bangin lian,
Aw khamuanpa hong tungta;
Tu’n i kiang ah A om gige,
Amah muangte sung ah teng.
Lailung muanna nuam,
Lungsung khawlna nuam;
Ka kha a kitheihna nuam,
Tuipi luahuai ah Jesu’n hon houpih;
Lauhuai tui kihawt adai.
Hinna leh kipahna ngen hi,
Zinpa vanglian omna peuh;
Ginlahna leh lauhna hawlmang;
A thu mangle’ng akhawlna.
Van a vuahtui hong kia bangin,
Van a nisa hong tang bang;
Tuabang in kha siangthou piak hi,
Van apan a hong tung hi.
En in, gahsuah ding akhangta,
Gahna hoih dikna a gah;
Hinna tui tuin aluangta,
Keuna gamdai ka kha ah.
Aw a lamdang hiai hotdamna,
Tanpa mel lungdamhuai muh;
Tenna nuam hi, tenna galmuang,
Tawlngakna nuam, khawlna nuam.

Kristian aw, pilvangin gal a honglang,
Hiai leitung a nang na khualzin laiin;
Setan khemna thang in nang honum kim,
Khemna tengteng na nuaisiah theita ding;
Kristian aw pilvangin, Kristian aw pilvangin,
Kristian aw pilvangin, gal a honglang.
Kristian aw, kipakin kuan’n lauhuai zong,
Tung khopi nim in, dougal lang mahleh;
Tung khopi nim daibang hongtheng ding hi,
Hondampa kiang ah mun na muangta ding;
Kristian aw kipakin, Kristian aw kipakin,
Kristian aw, kipakin, kuan’n lauhuai zong.
Kristian aw, thum thum in Pathian kiangah,
Na Toupa in honsam, mangngilh kenla;
Hondampa kianga na thumthum a leh,
Setan khemna lak ah na vualzou ding;
Kristian aw thumthumin, Kristian aw thumthumin,
Kristian aw, thumthumin, Pathian kiang ah.
Kristian aw, lamenin, lungkham lechin,
Thangvan khawlna munnuam na luah ding hi;
Toupa’n vai a hawm chia, na muanna di’n,
Na Toupa kipahna tak ah lut in;
Kristian aw lamenin, kristian aw lamenin,
Kristian aw, lamenin, lungkham lechin.

Leisep gimna a bei chian,
Kei ka tengdenta ding hi;
Launa, kihuat beina gam ah,
Ka hondampa mel mu in;
Van ah ka mun ka luah dia,
Nitumna kongpi ka tun chian.
Nitumna kongpi ka tun chian,
Hotdamte’n thupi’n hon ngak uh,
Ka puakgik ka ngakhe dia;
Sana manglukhu ngah ning,
Nitumna kongpi ka tun chian.
Ka lungkham jeljel mahleh,
Lamet kipahna ka nei;
Ka tot lampi tang ahi ziak’n,
Khelhna lungkhamna teng pan;
Ka suakta ding chih ka thei,
Nitumna kongpi ka tun chian.
Bangbel nopna hontun diam,
Ka it Toupa ka muh chian;
A thupina a kipakin,
Ka lung bangchi nop ding hiam;
Ka kha kilawpna’n dim ding,
Nitumna kongpi ka tun chian.
Mangpha chih om nawnlou ding,
Dah leh kah mit om nawnlou;
Hotdamte’n hon ngakna gam ah,
Kei ka tengdenta ding hi,
Tua sana luipang nuam ah;
Nitumna kongpi ka tun chian.

Ka lungsim Jesu ka piak nung,
Ka hinkhua nuam tuan mahmah,
A itna ah ka kha’n niteng in nuamsa;
A maipha ka muh mateng in;
A sul kajui kajui ding,
Ka lungah A itna tengta ding.
A itna lungah teng hi, A itna lungah teng,
Tua in mial chimtakhuai, tengteng hawlmangvek;
Kalvari a kros tungah Jesu nang leh kei di’n si,
Ka lungah A itna tengta hi.
Damsung puakgik agikluat chian,
Jesu’n ka lung kipaksak;
Muanna khovel in a lakkhiak zoh ngeilouh,
Tuabang Lawm naipen, manpha toh;
Om in, lungbuai ngei kei ning,
Ka lungah A itna tengta ding.
Niteng’ Amah ka it semsem,
Hiai nuai leia ka zin lai’n;
Lam tawntunga ka buaina teng hon vaksak,
Lawm itpen leh dikpen a hi,
Chih ka thei gige ding hi;
Ka lungah a itna tengta hi.

Halleluijah Jeho phat un,
Van pan A min pahtawi un;
Tungnungpen Jehovah phat un,
Angelte’n phat in phuang un;
A sepaihte’n pahtawi uhen,
Ni leh kha leh aksite’n;
Van a om tengteng aw phat un,
Vandum khen a tuipi’n leng.
Amau Jehovah phat uhen,
Amah’ min  kia tungnungpen;
Amah’ thupina kitawi sang (3)
Lei leh vandum khen lam ah.
Amau Jehovah phat uhen,
A thupiak a bawl hi uh;
Tangtawn a om di’n amau bawl,
A thukhen tangtawn daih ding;
Leia pan phat un Jehovah,
Nou tuilian dragon tengteng;
Mei leh gial, vuk, tuihu, huihpi,
A sapna za teng tengte’n.
Gahpha sing leh sidar singte,
Tangsang leh mual tengtengte;
Bokvakte, gamsa, innsate,
Tunga leng vasate aw;
Lei kumpite leh mipite,
Lei lal thupi vaihawmte;
Nungak, tangval, aneu alian,
A min pahtawi in phat un.

Jesu kei di’n bangkim ahi.
Hinna, nopna bangkim;
Niteng in ka hatna ahi,
Amah louin puk ning;
Dahlai in Amah kiang ka juan,
Kipaksak thei kua dang omlou;
Ka dah chiangin hon kipak sak, ka lawm hi.
Jesu kei di’n bangkim ahi,
Ze-etna ah ka lawm;
Vualjawlna di’n Amah ka juan,
Aman hon pia hon pia;
Nisa leh vuahtui bang hon pia,
Buhlak ding buhmin hoih hon pia;
Nisa leh vuah haichi min bang, ka lawm hi.
Jesu kei di’n bangkim ahi,
Amah’ di’n muanhuai ning;
Tuabang lawm ka tawpsan thei diam?
Amah banga lawm dik;
Amah zuih ka hihdik ka thei,
Sun leh zan in Aman hon veng;
Sun leh zan Amah ka zuih leh, ka lawm hi.
Jesu kei di’n bangkim ahi,
Lawm hoihzaw dang ngailou;
Ka ging Amah ka ging jel ding,
Ka sihni tanpha in;
Damsung kilawm tuabang lawm toh,
Hinna kilawm bei ngeilou ding;
Tangtawn hinna, tangtawn pahna, ka lawm hi.

Kristian tuailaite thou un,
Toupa’n nasem di’n hon sam;
Na hatna leh na pilna,
Na theihna leh na siamna;
Kris leh a gam adingin,
Na khempeuh Amah pia in;
Mial thuneihna hawlmang ni.
Kristian tuailaite thou un,
Na hinna kivelpha in;
A dik lampi na jui maw?
A siangthou lampi tawn in,
Setan tung a thahatna,
Mohna tung a vualzoh na;
Zaila sa in tangkou ni.
Kristian tuailaite thou un,
Na zatdan na hun en in;
Absalom hun zat ngaihsun’n,
A hat Samson hunte zong;
A hehpihhuai hun zangte,
Tuabang nang zong na om leh;
Manlangin kikhel meng in.
Kristian tuailaite thou un,
Aman pha in hun zang in;
Jakob ta tuailai Joseph.
Hun zat dangte ngaihsun ni;
Toupa deihna bang semin,
Niteng singlamteh pua in;
Pakkhia ni mun khempeuh ah.
Kristian tuailaite thou un,
Toupa’n nasep ding honpia;
Tangthupha tangkoupih di’n,
A mang khate zong dingin;
Hotdamna huangzawl sung ah,
Amaute pilut dingin;
Tuailiate liangkou’h hong nga.
Hotdamna huangzawl sung ah,
Amaute pilut dingin;
Tuailiate liangkou’h hong nga.

Mangpen’ galdou i hi, sisan a tat i hi,
Mang Jesu dia doupih dingin, galdou i kilam en;
Sih lauhuai ah i leng, hizong nuam lasa in,
Mangpen galdou huaisiam Toupa’n i lungsim ahihhat.
Mangpen galdou i hi,
A phatna lasa ni;
Muanhuai in A na sem lehang,
Ei Pathian vanglian hi.
Mangpen’ galdou ihi, A min nunnuam i pua,
Toupa Jesu a kilhden ua, A kungtung a min om;
Mang galdou i hi ua, i kiam punna’n i ngai,
Toupa Jesu’ min pahtawina’n, lungkham, dahna’h nuam ni.
Mangpen’ galdou i hi, A kiang ah kilang ni,
Lungkham dahna i tan pihna’n, A kiangah thuak lehang;
Kros ah mabang pan le’ng, sunsawt kivei lou ding;
Vangletna ni a hong naita, Mangpen galdoute di’n.

Jesu khut ah ka bit hi,
A angsung ah ka bit;
Tua’h A itna in hon liah, ka kha muang in khawl ding;
Ngai un, Angelte aw ging thupi na gam lei ah,
Tuipi kilawm kan in ka kiangah zaila hong tung.
Jesu khut ah ka bit hi,
A angsung ah ka bit;
Tua’h A itna in hon liah,
Ka kha muang in khawl ding.
Jesu khut ah ka bit hi,
Lungbuaina pan bit ing;
Khovel khemna pan bit hi’ng, khelhna’n hon hihbuai lou;
Lung khamna pan bit ing, ginlahna leh launa pan;
Zeetna leh khitui luannate om lai zek ding.
Jesu, ka lungtang buaina,
Jesu kei di’n si hi;
Kumtawn suangpi ah dingkip in ka muangdenta ding;
Tua’h kuhkal in ka ngak ding, zanmial bei ding ngak ing;
Suangmantam luipiau a jing khua hong vak ding ngak ing.

Puan hoih leh ngou silh in,
Tua gam hoih leh vak ah;
Innpi hoih leh tang ah,
Zan omnawnlouhna ah;
Manglukhu hoih khu in,
Tua ah nibang tangin;
Huai innpi kilawm ah,
Kikhawmta ni.
Puan hoih silh in, gam hoih a teeng,
Innpi kilawm, Pawl nuamsate;
Manglukhu hoih, hoihtaka taang,
Innpi hoih leh vak ah, kikhawmta ni.
Ka ngaihtuahna hoih toh,
Kumkhua in ka om ding;
Tangtawn hinna Nang ah,
Hiai khovel pawtsan chiang’;
Lungngaih sepgim beita,
Van kipahna tangin;
Tua lam gal ah kai ding,
Ka thumna hi.
Vantung thilhoihte toh,
Vandum khenlam pek ah;
Hiai luipang nawsia in,
Vantung goute en in;
Sih theihlouhna mun ah,
Honpi kaita ding a;
Dahna thuak nawnlou di’n,
Van lungmuanna.

Sihna luigal ah kituak ni,
Jesu si a ngou puan silh in;
Natna beita nunnuam nihang,
Kikhen launa om nawn louhna;
Sihna luigal lam ah.
Sihna luigal lam ah, (3)
Kituak ni khen lou di’n: (4)
Sihna luigal lam ah.
Tu’n dahna hongtung zong laukeng,
Ginna’n ka van inn ka muta,
Ginna’n Angelte gen ka za,
Na Toupa’n khitui nulsiang ding;
Sihna luigal lam ah.
Lawmvual it toh kituahna nuam,
Pahna bangteng ka za diam aw;
Sana kongkhak ka lut khit chian,
Ka kha’n nunnuam bangteng gawm dia;
Sihna luigal lam ah.
Hondampa it ka khe piin,
Tua pahna kim ka tan theihna’n;
Khitui hon nulsiang tua itna,
Pak a tangtawn a ka hintheihna’n;
Sihna luigal lam ah.

Suangmantam luipang nuam a,
Ginomte kikhen louhna’h;
Damsung huihpi a then chian, hontuak in,
Tua mun ah zanmial omlou,
Sunni vak leh siang suak vek;
Tua inn a teng di’n ka pai, hontuak in.
Hontuak in, hontuak in,
Hinna sing apakna mun ah, hontuak in,
Damsung huihpi a then chian;
Suangmantam luipang nuam ah,
Ginomte kikhen louhna’h, hon tuak in.
Lam-et deihpen zong vuaksuak,
Ki-itpente zong kikhen;
Hizong van ah nat omlou, hontuak in.
Tua lui tuipaksilsial kiang’h,
Lungdamna khopi tual ah;
I ginna muhlouhna ah, hontuak in.
Angelte lasak ginna,
Tatte lasak tawntungna’h;
Kumpipa inn huangsung ah, hontuak in.
Lung kituaka lawm leh lawm,
Nuama kipolhkhawmna mun;
Khovel bei ngeilou ding ah, hontuak in.

Ka Hondampa hong thuakna tang;
Tua tang lauhuai leh mulkimhuai tung ah,
Ka thuak sikin a thuak.
Ka kipak ngei, Toupa ka kipak ngei,
Hichitel a itna lamdang;
Gensiam kei ve'ng hoih hina tel chia maw,
Hon phat chim kei ning e.
Hichi lawmlawm tel a itna lamdang,
Khelhna tuipi a tumsate;
Itna ziak a Na hon pikhiak man in;
Nang kia honjuita ning.
Na sisan in a hong zalenna gam,
Tua mun a hon pitung ding in;
Na Laukha a paibang n'on kop man in,
Ka lung a kim ngei e.
Genchim theikei ning e, Na hon itna,
Khovel thupina genlou in;
Anbang n'on itna thu kia gen ning e,
Toupa, hon panpih in.
Halleluijah Amen, Halleluijah,
Amen, Amen, Halleluijah;
Toupa vualjawlna chiteng hon petu,
Na min thupi hen aw.

Hiai khualzinna gam, nuai simlei ah,
Gimthuak a i mau lai in;
Pathian tate dia ni thupi pen,
Haibang i ngaklah ngei e.
Hiai khualzinna gam, simlei ahi,
Eite inn van ahi zaw;
Tuun ah gimthuak in, i mau zong a,
Denchiang zoh laa i sa ding.
Hiai khualzinna gam, nuai simlei ah,
Lungmuanna ding a omlou;
Van-gam nuam ah zaw, lungkim tak in;
Nuam in i khawl denta ding.
Hiai khualzinna gam, nuai simlei ah,
Thupina neilou te'n zong;
Van-gam nuam ah zaw, Belamnou in,
Thupi tak in a thuam ding.

Ka galvan nusia ngam la'ng e;
Aw ka tenna gal lauhna mun;
Niteng khemna in hon dou e,
Aw, ka Hondampa nusia ding in.
Hon galthuam aw, Immanuel,
Na Laukha in hon galthuam in;
Hiai lei gilou mial gal thupi,
Nang din ka hon dou jel ding hi.
Bah leh nguitak a ka om a,
Nang dia dawilawk mel ka puak chiang'n;
Galzoute ding a Manglukhu,
Aw, Na bawl pen hon hilh thak jel in.
Aw, hon en dih ka Hondampa,
Na sisan a Na tatsate;
Hiai lei gilou mial kulh sung ah,
Aw, tang uh e, Toupa simsenglouh.
Nang N'on panpih leh melmate,
Zou jel ning, Na sisan vang in;
Na tangtawn gou luahpih ding in;
Aw, sual sal apan hon pikhia ning.
Denchiang a jingkhua hongvak chian,
Ka Hondampa mel ka mu ding;
Tua ah galvan ka ngata ding,
Aw, puan ngou thupi hon silhsak ding.

Ka kumsawt inn ding lemta ning e,
Kumsawt Suangpi kip Kris tung a lem in;
A hun laiin theihtawp in lam ning,
Ka omna simlei inn hong mangpah ding.
Kumsawta hinna inn kip Kris pen ka neita e,
Damlai huihpi leh tuipi hong kihawt mahleh;
Kris vang in kei a hon tum talou ding.
Aw, envel dih loubang tul simlei,
Lungkhamna leh natna'n a dim zouta;
A tung ah lungmuanna omta lou,
Siatna tuipi a kihawt tak ziak in.
Aw, sihna tuipi a hong lianta;
Zion taten innsang lamtouta ni;
Laukha Siangthou hinna'n kithuam ni,
Hinna Sangpen innsang tungnung ahi.

Ke'n hoihna khat zong ka nei lou,
Jesu Kris hoihna koppih in;
Amah vanga dika sim in ka om lel hi,
Aw tu in zong hoihna ka neilou;
Ka hihna zaw mikhial lel ka hi,
Kris vanga siangthou;
Kris vanga hoih, ka hi lel hi.
Kris hoihna kei a ahi ta,
A sianthouna kei a ahi ta;
A hihna A hon nei sak a,
A hon pomta;
Tu'n ah lau ding ka nei nawnlou,
A huang ah muang in ka om,
Kris hoihna leh sianthouna kei a ahi ta.
Kei mahmah ka ki et chiang in,
Sianthouna hoihna ka neilou;
Hizong Ama'n siangthou in a hon pomta hi,
Amah nna te ka semthei ta a;
A paina ah ka pai theita hi,
Kris vaka nungta'n;
Amah bang in a hon bawl ta.

Khovel a ka len sung in,
Ka hindan ding hong hilh in;
Hiai khovel ka inn a hih louh dan,
Ka mun ding na kiang hi zaw;
Ka inn ding na kiang hi zaw,
Kipak a kong tun theihna di'n.
Hong theisak in aw Toupa,
Khovel ka leen sung in;
Na deih leh na lunggelna,
Nisim in kei hong hilh in;
Ka nunna leh kalsuante,
Toupa aw kei hong pi in aw.
Khovel a ka leen sung in,
Toupa aw kei hong hilh in;
Ka deihtelnate na deih hi di'n,
Na paina ka pai theih a;
Na khawlna a khawl thei din,
Ka lutang nanglam hei in aw.
Khovel a ka leen sung in,
Kei tunga a hong tungte;
Nang a pan na sawl hi jel hen aw,
Nopnate ka tuah ni in;
Dahnate ka tuahni in,
Ka khitui nang honsawl hi hen.

I mu van gam thupi;
Lei a lungkham tate laitual lenna,
Belamnou leh hinna sing pal jou in;
Hehpihte tualleng uh;
A thupi e, kipak in la sa ni.
Aw sisan pha, zaila'n hon pak ning e,
Na hon itna thupi;
Kalvari a tatna sisan,
Zaila'n kon pahtawi ding.
Lung a juan ni'n bangkim gelgel lehang,
Kipahna hong nai e,
Hehpihpa' sisan ziak a kipahna;
Vangnei kisa'ng, Pathian' tate ding in,
Kris Toupa'n hon bawlta;
Kipahna kim zaw Toupa nasep hi.
Ka tankhom a kipahna thupipen,
Hehpihna siangthou hi;
Pathian' ta hih leh Ama' nasepna;
Hon veng inla, kei ah Na nna sem in,
Aw ka Toupa it aw;
Hong zang in aw, kha mangthang man ding in.

Lungkham buaina'n mangbang hon bawm,
Mohna'n khimjing bang hon tuam:
Hizong khua hong vak dekta,
Vantung ah Hondampa vaak:
Zion mualsang pan hong kum dia.
Tatte kipah lasa in;
Nun khua nuamin zaila sa ni;
Ahong kumsuk chiang.
Lungkham dah nunnuam un,
Nou di'n vang letna sunni hong naita hi;
Nunnop zaila sain;
I Toupa i ngaka hongpai naita hi.
Jesu sisan pha a tatte;
Suah tum sum leh mal a mi;
Hong kik un-chin nuam leh pakin,
Tut khawlna gam chiam tang di'n;
Chi chih leh namchih lai apan,
Gamchin ate hong pai un,
Nun khua nuamin zaila sa-ni;
Ahong kumsuk chiang.
Sun leh zan a Amah ngakte,
Aman hon huai khawm vek ding;
Tut khawllou in A nna sem leng,
Laukha namtemte zangin;
Nuai leitung mohna khimjing ah,
I khawn vakvak sak ve-ni;
Nun kho nuam in zaila sa-ni,
A hongkum suk chiang.
Hon gum Toupa hong kumsuk in,
Sepgim te'n honngak lah uh;
Aw bang chik chiang kon mu ding ua?
Na van gam khopi vak toh;
Na kum khua mi siangthoute leh,
Namchihna hotdamte toh;
Nangmah phata nunnop zaila'
Sakkal ngaklah ung.

Khelhna ah ka na tum thuk,
Muanna luigal apan;
Gamlapi leh thukpi ah,
Thou nawnlou di’n ka tum,
Hizong tuipi Heutupa’n,
Chimoh ka kah honza;
Tui apat hon domkang hi,
Tu’n ka bitta.
$: Itna’n hon dom (2)
Hon huhthei omlouh chian;
Itna’n hon dom.
D.S.
Ka lungsim teng Amah pia’ng,
Amah ka len gige;
A vualjawlna maia hing,
A phatla sa gige;
Itna hat hi, itna dik,
Ka kha’n la hoih in phat;
Ginom, itna nasep toh,
Amah’ a hi’ng.
Kha laute aw, entou un,
Jesu’n hondam siang vek;
A itna’n nang hon dom ding,
Tui kihawt lauhuai’ pan;
Amah tuipi Heutu hi,
Tuipite’n A thu mang;
Na Hondampa’n hon deih hi,
Tu’n hotdam hi’n.

Nuai simlei nguizouta a tung a mihingte tawh;
Gitlouhna leh gimhuai in dimzouta;
I it i ngaihteng leh vualngeihte'n mualkhum zou.
Aw, Belam nunnem in gam thak A bawlna mun,
Aw, ka kha aw nang leng tua gam lam zong sam in;
Simlei tuangnung siah chia na omna mun ding in.
Dikna gam siamzouta, aw i tangtawn gamlei ding,
Lei lungkhamna gamsia hong chim mahleh;
Mang Kris na muan a-leh gam thak ah na leng ding.
Tang a i pi leh puten a muhphak louh gam uh,
Sisan vang in kei in ka na muta;
Tua gam zotna lampi i Mang Kris kia ahi.

A nabawl ding ka Toupa paita;
Hotdamte gam nunnuam ah,
Hotdamsa ka itte tawh;
Lutkhawm ding, phat la kisa tawntung ding.
Kum sawt lua om ngeilou,
Kipahna gam ah zaw;
Gim, gentheih om nawnlou,
Tua mun ah khatvei tei i teng ding.
Kei ding in Hondampa hong sita,
Ka kha hotdamna honpiak theihna'ng;
Hiai lei hin gentheihna mun,
Pel in ken ka nusia ding;
Van gamnuam hoihtak a tengden ding in.
Hun leh ni tampi ah aw Toupa,
Nang non ompih tawntung chih ka thei;
Mang lou hial in Toupa aw,
I tenkhawmna ding mun ah;
Ngaihtuam, muhdah omlou, lemna lengta.
Thangvan gamnuam sana khopi ah,
Nat-le-sat, gentheihna om nawn lou;
Lungdam la sa tawntung ding,
Gim leh tawl bei vekta ding;
Nunnuam tawntung ding, tua innpi nuam ah.

Thou aw, ka kha, thou aw,
Na khelhna paisan in;
A hon tatna sisan,
Keia ding a hong luang;
Mang tutphah mai keisik din ding,
Ka min A khut ah kigelhta.(2)
Kei dia hon thumsak ding,
Vantung ah Toupa om;
A hon khasiat tatna,
A sisan pha in gen;
A si in khelhna teng silsiang,
Hehpihna tutphah maiah theh.(2)
Kalvari a hiamma,
Mun nga a A thuakte;
Thumna manpha hi uh,
Kei di'n nakpi'n thum uh;
Ngaidam in aw, ngaidam in aw,
Mawhte tatsa sih phalken chi.(2)
Ka Pathian lungdamta,
A ngaihdam aw ka za;
A ta ding in hon nei,
Ka lau nawn kei hial hi;
"Abba, Pa aw, Pa aw," chi in,
Lung a muang in tun ka juan hi.(2)

Tou Jesu ka neih man in,
Bangdang thupi om ta lou;
Tou Jesu neih kei adin a hun hi,
Siamna, sanna hauhnate;
Bangmah neilou ka hi zong,
Tou Jesu neih kei adin ahun hi.
Tou Jesu neih kei adi'n,
Bangteng sang in amanpha;
Tou Jesu neih ka hauh na pen ahi.
Hiai khovel in mihai bang lel in;
hon sim taleh zong,
Tou Jesu neih kei adin ahun hi.
Taksap hunte hontung a,
Lametna abei zong in;
Tou Jesu neih kei adin ahun hi,
Theipi kung pallun lou in;
Huang ah ganta bei zong in,
Tou Jesu neih kei adin ahun hi.
Zaitha hatna hong bei in,
Pallai ni hong vulzong in;
Tou Jesu neih kei adin ahun hi,
Teek leh vuai hun hong tung a;
Tung sunni akai ta zong,
Tou Jesu neih kei adin ahun hi.

Toupa na kiangah ka muangta ding,
Dahna lungkhamna ki lel lou ding;
Na siang nuam a ka len chiang,
Damsung khosak buaina haksatna,
Leigim haksatna ka thuakte uh;
Tua mun nuam ah om nawnlou.
Tul ngeilou ding kipahna,
Tul ngeilou ding nunnopna;
Sisan a na gam chiam,
Tua mun ah kalen hun chiang;
Tul ngeilou in ka leng ding.
Hun in lenmual khum a liamjel in,
Ka lei nunnate a liampih a;
Theihlouh kal in a bei jel,
Simlei nunnopna ka zon te uh;
Tangtawn lungnopna a ching zoulou,
Na siang kia ah bukim hi.
Vang nei ki sa’ng e ka ngaihsut chiang,
Nunnuam kisa’ng e ka lunggel chiang;
Hon neisakta ka Toupa’n,
Leitung buaina ten a sukkhak louh;
Tawntung lungnop na’n a luahna gam,
Ka Toupa vang ka neita.

Toupa na tate lai ah kawlni suak sim in,
Huhamna leh siatna in;
Ka gam uh aluah zou,
Ki itte ki laizomte dougal a suak zouta;
Ki itna'n mun a nei nawn ta lou.
I thou ding aw i juan ding,
Toupa i juan ding uh;
I gam zong Toupa'n a hon it lai,
Bang hang a i Toupa mel liahtu i hi lailai;
Kisik in Toupa i juan ding uh.
Khelhvang in aw sen momnou,
Sanggah a tam ngei;
A it huai a naupangte nangawn in zong a thuak,
A poi in a mulkimhuai tulai i nuntakna;
I Toupa a melsiatna a hi.
Zuang hongthou un tun leh zua,
Chin leh tuaite aw;
Kisathei in om kei ni kingaihniam a hun ta,
Kisik a I sulhei leh ngaihdamna i tang ding;
A liam ma'n i juan meng ding uhi.

Tuisuahgiat bang a hehpihna,
Tuilet bang in migitna;
Hinna Mang siangthou A sihna;
Ka hinna tan a si hi;
A hon itna ngilh teitei a,
Phatlou kuahiam om thei ding;
Tawplou hialin van om sungteng,
Amah ngilh lou hial ding uh.
En dih, kalvari mual tung ah,
Selguk thugil a puakzak;
Pathian hehpihna'n achinkhawm;
A luangzak kiman lawmlawm;
Pathian itna leh lainatna,
Mihing lam ah a luangkhawm;
Dikna leh itna kituak in,
Khovel mawhpua pomta uh.

Ding un, ding un, Jesu di’n, nou kros sepaihte aw;
Kumpi puanlap khaisang un, vuallel lou hial dingin.
Vualzou a vualzou jel di’n, A sepaihte pi ding;
Melma zouvek a Kris kia, Toupa ahih mateng.
Ding un, ding un, Jesu di’n, pengkul sapna jui un;
Tuni a ni thupi ah, gal khawkna lam juan un;
Simsenglouh melma dou a, A na sem lelte aw;
Lauhuai ah hangsan sem in, dou un zou ngei dingin.
Ding un, ding un, Jesu di’n, A hatna ah ding un;
Sa bantha hatna muang ken; nangmah kia kimuang ken;
Gospel galvan a thuam in, thum kawm a vil gige’n;
Lauhuaina mun pen ah zong, thanuam takin sem in.
Ding un, ding un Jesu di’n, buaina sawt nawnlou ding,
Tuni’n kidouna thawmging, jingchia zohla sa ding;
Aman galzoute kiang ah, hinna lukhu pe ding,
Thupina kumpipa toh, tangtawn vaihawmta ding.

Lungsim thawmhau kep ding om uh,
Nite kiam, apai lai in;
Laukha tawl a mangthang om uh,
Nite kiam, apai lai in;
I nuihmel thaksak thei le’ng,
I zinna’ i pai kawmin;
Aw thilhoih i hih thei chiat,
Nite kiam, apai lai in
Nite kiam, nite kiam (2)
Aw thilhoih i hih thei chiat;
Nite kiam, apai lai in.
Mi huat mawkna ding hun om lou,
Nite kiam, apai lai in;
Na mel jingsang vak bang tang hen,
Nite kiam, apai lai in;
Aw, leitung lungkhamna’n dim,
Dah leh kahna mit in dim;
Na unau kipuk phongin,
Nite kiam, apai lai in
Itna khau a henkhawmte teng,
Nite kiam, apai lai in;
Khat khatin nung ah nusia hang,
Nite kiam, apai lai in;
Hizong chihoih i tuhte,
Niliap leh sa ah pou ding;
I lungsim hon vaksak ding,
Nite kiam, apai lai in

Ka Tanpa ahing chih ka thei hi,
Lei tungah vai a hawm nawn ding;
Tangtawn hinna A pia chih ka thei,
Hehpihna leh hatna A nei.
Ka thei, ka thei ka Tanpa hing hi;
Leitung ah hong ding nawn ding hi;
A hinna A pia hi chih ka thei,
Hehpihna leh hatna A nei.
A thuchiam zuau ngeilou chih ka thei,
Thu A gena, a si thei nawn lou;
Sih mulkimhuai in ka sa sual zong,
Denchiangin Amah ka mu ding.
Ka omna ding A bawl chih ka thei,
Amah kiang a ka om theih na’ng;
Kei hon khotuahna lamdang mahmah,
Ni tawpni chian kei hongpi ding.

Tumlam ah ni atum a,
Lei leh van a tawlngata;
Zan aksite hong tang uh,
Amah be di’n ngak chiat uh;
Van lai jawl ah.
Siangthou (3) Toupa Pathian,
Lei leh van ah Nang na dim;
Lei leh van in Nang hon pak,
Toupa sangpen.
Nang hinna Toupa na hi,
Nangmah in vansinnuai ah;
Nang hon zongte pikhawmin,
Na angsung ah hon pom in,
Nang nong nai hi.
Zan a hong mial deuhdeuh chian,
Itna lung in hon tuam in;
Thupina leh zahngaihna’n,
Na maikhuh aksite in;
Kou lunglawp sak.
Aksite, nite, zante,
Ka muh nawnlouh hun chiang un;
Tangtawn jingkhua vakta hen,
Toupa, kou hon musak in;
Mial beita hen.

Jesu min lian phat chiat ni e,
Angelte’n bia’n kun hen;
Angelte’n bia’n kun hen;
Mangpen lukhu honla unla.
Khusak...khusak, khusak, khusak,
Khusak..miteng Toupa.
Nou Israel nam chitelte,
Pukna pan tatte aw;
Pukna pan tatte aw;
Hehpihna a hon tan phat un.
Mi namchih leh zat chichihte,
Hiai leitung van nuai ah;
Hiai leitung van nuai ah;
Thupina teng Amah pia un.
Aw, hua’ mipi siangthoute toh,
A khebul ah kun le’ng;
A khebul ah kun le’ng;
Tangtawn a tawplou la sa in.

Kros ma’h kun in, Kris in hon tuak ding,
Aman hon gensak hi;
Na aw suah in,
Na buaina pia in;
Hinna thak panta in.
Kros ma’h kun in,
Amah muang in;
Kros ma’h  kun in,
Jesu’n hon na tuak ding.
Kros ma’h kun in, miteng di’n mun om,
Avang jou nuam teng di’n;
Pahna’n hon ngak,
Nat om nawnlou ding;
Huai mun tungte dingin.
Kros ma’h kun in, dawi biak tawpsan in,
Vantung gam lam-en in;
Nunghei nawn ken,
Hinna siangthou pan;
A itna’h muangta in.

Pialmanglou di’n honpi in, Hondampa aw lamtawn in;
Na kiang ah ka bit ding hi, Na itna ah teng nuam ing.
Honpi’n, honpi’n,
Hondampa, pialmanglou di’n;
Hun tui luang bangin kiam hi,
Lamtawn’n honpi’n Hondampa.
Ka kha bukna Nang na hi, damsung huihpi a hatchian;
Nang nong nai chian ka bit hi, ka lam-et teng Nang ah om.
Hondampa aw honpi’n, damsung huihpi a then chian;
Tawpni neihlouhna gam ah, khitui nul siangna mun ah.

Saltanna lungkhamna mialna pan,
Jesu kon juan, Jesu kon juan;
Nang zalenna, kipahna vak ah,
Jesu, Na kiang kon juan;
Damlouhna pan, Nanga damna juan,
Taksapna pan, Na hauhsakna juan;
Ka khelhna pan, nangmah a lut di’n,
Jesu, Na kiang kon juan.
Manna leh chinlouhna zumhuaipan,
Jesu kon juan, Jesu kon juan;
Na kros a punna thupi kon juan,
Jesu na kiang kon juan;
Lei lungkhamna pan, Nanga damna,
Damsung huihpihat pan, Na kiang dai ah;
Mangbatna pan kipahna la sa’n,
Jesu, Na kiang kon juan.
Lungkimmoh leh kisaktheihna pan,
Jesu kon juan, Jesu kon juan;
Na kros a punna thupi kon juan,
Jesu, Na kiang kon juan;
Kei, kia hi’ng, Na itna a teng di’n,
Lungkiakna pan tunglam nopsakna ah;
Vakhu bangin tunglam ah leng ning,
Jesu, Na kiang kon juan.
Hankhuk mulkimhuai leh launa pan,
Jesu kon juan, Jesu kon juan;
Na inn nunnuam leh vak a teng di’n,
Jesu, Na kiang kon juan;
Siatna thuk genvuallouh apan in,
Na kiang bukna leh muanna huang kon juan;
Na mel thupi mu gigeta ding,
Jesu, Na kiang kon juan.

Ka kiangah hon sa nawn dihve,
Hinna thu lamdangte;
A kilawmna hon ensak in,
Hinna thu lamdangte;
Hinna leh thu hoihte,
Gin leh hih ding hon hilh.
Thu kilawmte, thu lamdangte,
Hinna thu lamdangte;
Thu kilawmte, thu lamdangte,
Hinna thu lamdangte.
Hampha Kris in miteng kiangpia,
Hinna thu lamdangte;
Mikhial, itna sapna ngai khia’n
Hinna thu lamdangte;
Miteng manbei in pia,
Van tung dingin hon sawl.
Gospel sapna ginngaih in thawn,
Hinna thu lamdangte;
Miteng ngaihdamna, muanna pia,
Hinna thu lamdangte;
Hondampa Jesu kia’n
Hon hih siangthou tawntung.
